  "bodyHash": "a391da26ebecd9cb",
  "content": "\n\n<h4><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>JourneyMap-Teams</strong></span></h4>\n<p>適用於 <a href=\"https://files.minecraftforge.net/net/minecraftforge/forge/\">Forge</a>、<a href=\"https://neoforged.net/\">NeoForge</a>、<a href=\"https://fabricmc.net/\">Fabric</a> 與 <a href=\"https://quiltmc.org/en/\">Quilt </a>的客戶端與伺服器模組，為 <a href=\"https://legacy.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/journeymap\">JourneyMap </a>的附加模組，提供與支援的團隊模組及 Vanilla Teams 的整合。</p>\n<h4><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>說明文件與協助</strong></span></h4>\n<p>可於 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/eP8gE69\">JourneyMap Discord </a>伺服器獲得支援</p>\n<h4><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>伺服器端</strong> </span>- <em>選填</em></h4>\n<p>隱藏非您隊伍成員或盟友的玩家。</p>\n<h4><strong><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">客戶端</span> </span></strong>- <em>選填</em></h4>\n<p>根據隊伍顏色為隊友圖示與名稱標籤上色。此功能包含盟友。</p>\n<h4><span style=\"text-decoration: underline; font-size: 18px;\"><strong>支援的團隊模組：</strong></span></h4>\n<ul>\n<li>FTB Teams <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-teams-forge/\">Forge</a>&nbsp;與 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/ftb-teams-fabric\">Fabric</a></li>\n<li>Vanilla Teams</li>\n<li>Better Teams（透過 Paper 插件）<br /><br /></li>\n</ul>\n<p>歡迎提出需求，以新增更多團隊模組的支援。</p>",
  "contentType": "text/markdown",
  "type": "modrinth"
}
